@startuml k9x_origin_big_picture
title A K9-AIF agent's three paths: knowing, current truth, doing

actor "Person\n(K9X HIL)" as Person
rectangle "K9-AIF solution" {
  component "Orchestrator → Squad" as Squad
  component "Agent" as Agent
  component "Business rules\n(K9RulesAgent)" as Rules
}
component "k9x Shield" as Shield

package "Knowledge (what do our documents say?)" {
  component "K9Retriever" as Ret
  database "Vector database\n(policies, contracts, manuals)" as VDB
}
package "Current truth (what is true right now?)" {
  component "k9x Origin" as Origin
  database "Live state\n(memory / Redis)" as Live
}
package "Actions (change something)" {
  component "MCP tools / APIs" as Tools
}
database "Systems of record\n(ERP, claims, payments, vendor master)" as SOR
queue "Event streams\n(Kafka / Confluent, Flink)" as Streams

Squad --> Agent
Agent --> Ret : search by meaning
Ret --> VDB
Agent --> Origin : get_current(entity, id)
Origin --> Live
Streams --> Live : push (continuous)
Origin ..> SOR : pull: read-through / verify
Agent --> Tools : act, carrying Origin's version
Tools --> SOR
SOR --> Streams : changes become events
Agent --> Rules : facts
Rules --> Person : RequiresHIL
Shield .. Ret : screens results
Shield .. Origin : screens requests and answers
Shield .. Tools : screens tool calls (egress)
@enduml
